<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Minor Gate</h1>
<p>Sphere: Summoning Sphere
Class: Conjurer (guild level 27), Sorcerer (guild level 30)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast minor gate &lt;someone&gt;
</pre>
<p>Opens a portal and pulls a person or creature from anywhere in the world to 
you, in a puff of smoke. It only works on someone of your own level or 
lower, and not when one of you stands where magic can't reach. Arriving 
disoriented, the one you summon may well attack you, and the effort leaves 
you slow for a couple of rounds.
</p><p>The spell may fail. If it does, the one you tried to summon knows it. Someone 
in a fight is harder to pull away. And about one cast in twenty tears a rift 
in the powers of magic instead: all your mana is gone, and something else 
may come through.
</p><p>You must be standing. It is also found on scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
